OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FA look at the work of the King's
OL,7,     Fstroke team, who treat over 1300
OL,8,     Fpatients a year. And the UK's
OL,9,     Fover-40s BMX champion visits A&E
OL,10,     Fafter falling 20 feet when a stunt
OL,11,     Fwent wrong.
OL,12,G0010 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FThe heli-medics race to Linda,
OL,14,     Fwho's had a heart attack on a
OL,15,     FNorfolk beach. Motocross rider
OL,16,     FAlex is hit by a bike. And
OL,17,     F15-year-old Dan is treated for a
OL,18,     Fpossible skull fracture.
